# SCORM Player

A web-based SCORM Player built using React, Node.js, and Express. It allows users to upload SCORM ZIP files, extract the course contents, and play the course directly in the browser.

## Features

- Upload SCORM courses in ZIP format.
- Extract SCORM ZIP files on the server.
- Automatically identify the SCORM launch file from `imsmanifest.xml`.
- Display uploaded course information.
- Play SCORM courses inside an iframe.
- Basic SCORM 2004 runtime API support.
- Simple and user-friendly interface.
- Support for uploading multiple courses.

## Technologies Used

### Frontend
- React.js
- Vite
- JavaScript
- CSS

### Backend
- Node.js
- Express.js
- Multer
- AdmZip
- CORS

